<tbody><tr>
<td id="fileinfotpl&#95;desc" class="fileinfo-paramfield" lang="en">Description<span class="summary fn" style="display:none">MenstrualCycle2.png</span></td>
<td class="description">
Depicts the variation through the menstrual cycle of the major hormones involved, basal body temperature, and relative endometrial thickness.  Created using OpenOffice.org, vector graphic file available at <a href="/w/index.php?title=File:MenstrualCycle2.sxd&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="File:MenstrualCycle2.sxd (page does not exist)">Image:MenstrualCycle2.sxd</a></td>
</tr>

<tr>
